$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,palace3

[ai6PriestCaptured]
<h2>~iKalrek</h2>
<p>Fool!  You truly are an idoit if you cannot understand directions, let alone follow them!
$Button=Ok,Tell,Failed
$Timeout=7,Tell,Failed

[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>You have failed to meet up with your master expectations.  In time you shall be able to pass this test.

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0

